k</p><div class="buy_row"><div class="button_message"><a class="button buy_btn" href="https://og-shmiggy.itch.io/clay-items/purchase">Download Now</a><span class="buy_message"><span class="sub">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="left_col column"><div class="formatted_description user_formatted"><p>Clay Items is a growing collection of stylized, low-poly pottery and tableware designed for games, prototypes and other real-time projects.</p>
<p>The free tier currently contains 10 models supplied in FBX, OBJ and glTF formats. Each model uses mostly quad-based, subdivision-ready topology, giving you the flexibility to keep the original low-poly appearance or add subdivision where needed.</p>
<h2>Included models</h2>
<ul><li>Bowl - 544 triangles
</li><li>Crockpot - 512 triangles
</li><li>Crockpot lid - 800 triangles
</li><li>Cup - 512 triangles
</li><li>Jug - 1,024 triangles
</li><li>Planter - 480 triangles
</li><li>Plate - 448 triangles
</li><li>Platter - 384 triangles
</li><li>Rice pot - 736 triangles
</li><li>Wide vase - 800 triangles
</li></ul>
<p>Triangle counts describe the exported game-ready meshes; the underlying topology is predominantly quad-based. Source tier is still a work in progress, more details below.<br></p>
<h2>Textures</h2>
<p>Two texture styles are included (UV-unwrapped):
</p>
<p>
    </p>
<ul><li>Flat-color texture - 256 Ã— 256 (PNG)
</li><li>Textured clay - 1,024 Ã— 1,024 (PNG)
</li><li>Textured clay normal map -&nbsp;1,024 Ã— 1,024 (PNG)<br>
</li><li>Textured clay roughness map- 1,024 Ã— 1,024 (PNG)</li></ul>
<p>The flat-color texture can be downsampled further for projects with tighter memory or performance requirements.</p>
<h2>File formats</h2>
<ul><li>FBX
</li><li>OBJ
</li><li>glTF
</li></ul>
<p>These are engine-agnostic exports. No Unity, Unreal, Godot or other engine-specific setup is currently included, so material configuration may vary between engines.
</p>
<h2>Work in progress</h2>
<p>This pack is actively being expanded, and more clay items are planned for future updates.
</p>
<p>A low-cost Plus tier with additional models and a separate Source tier containing editable source files are also planned.&nbsp;The upcoming Source tier will include the original Blender files for the 3D models and XCF files for the textures.&nbsp;Everyone will continue to have access to the free collection as it grows.
</p>
<p>Follow the project to be notified about future additions and paid tiers.
</p>
<h2>Licence</h2>
<p>The assets are released under CC0 1.0 Universal. You may use and modify them in personal and commercial projects without attribution.
</p>
<p>As a courtesy, please link people to this original itch.io page rather than repackaging the unchanged files, and please do not claim that you created the original models.
</p>
<h2>Feedback</h2>
